       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CLAY-ADVANCED.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CLAY-ADVANCED-PROOFS.
           05  WS-THIXOTROPIC-YIELD-RELAX  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-OVERHANG-SELF-SUPPORT-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-INTERLOCK-JOINT-TOLERANCE PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CAPILLARY-GLAZE-DIFFUSION PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CLAY-ADVANCED-SEAL-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-CLAY-ADV-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-CLAY-ADV-PROVEN      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-CLAY-ADV-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-YIELD-AND-SUPPORT.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-JOINTS-AND-GLAZE.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-CLAY-ADV-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-YIELD-AND-SUPPORT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-THIXOTROPIC-YIELD-RELAX.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-OVERHANG-SELF-SUPPORT-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-JOINTS-AND-GLAZE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-INTERLOCK-JOINT-TOLERANCE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CAPILLARY-GLAZE-DIFFUSION.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-CLAY-ADV-PROOFS.
           IF WS-THIXOTROPIC-YIELD-RELAX = 1 AND
              WS-OVERHANG-SELF-SUPPORT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-INTERLOCK-JOINT-TOLERANCE = 1 AND
              WS-CAPILLARY-GLAZE-DIFFUSION = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-CLAY-ADVANCED-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-CLAY-ADV-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-CLAY-ADV-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-CLAY-ADV-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-CLAY-ADV-CODE.
